			"notes": "# 1.2.0\n## Added\n- Added Froggy House structure. Generated one in the world.\n- Added Froggy Bed for Tamed Froggy.\n- Added eating food behavior for Tamed Froggy.\n- Added armor slots for Tamed Froggy.\n- Added Froggy Trader that spawns in the Froggy House with a new model.\n- Added /locatefh command for locating Froggy House.\n- Added Player Painting that renders dynamically player skin.\n## Changed\n- Changed texture and model for every Froggy entity.\n- Improved screaming animation.\n- Set global fleeing movement speed.\n- Changed mod icon.\n## Fixed\n- Removed duplicated code for Froggy Jumpscare entity."
		},
